{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Combat Cobras Arena and experience a fast-paced couch party game straight out of the golden age of arcades. Have intense battles in fully destructible arenas with up to 8 players. Last pixel standing wins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Battle with up to 8 friends:</strong> <br>Play on your own or with up to 8 players. Kill each other using any means necessary and be the last pixel alive. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/extras/4cb3d33973a66697257f38998dd86abc.poster.avif?t=1771323374\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/extras/4cb3d33973a66697257f38998dd86abc.webm?t=1771323374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/extras/4cb3d33973a66697257f38998dd86abc.mp4?t=1771323374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Compete in fully destructible arenas:</strong> <br>Every single pixel on screen in the combat arenas is fully destructible. Break other player's tails to create new opportunities, or completely tear apart the map. Anything goes.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/extras/d43de431ba203e97f8a36894abcb0b82.poster.avif?t=1771323374\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/extras/d43de431ba203e97f8a36894abcb0b82.webm?t=1771323374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/extras/d43de431ba203e97f8a36894abcb0b82.mp4?t=1771323374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A large arsenal of deadly weapons:</strong> <br>Weapons are placed around the maps and can be collected by players creating areas where engagements are inevitable. In the arena you'll find guns, missiles, mines, nukes, or even parasites. You know the usual. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/extras/de501cf9310a111a8201840370f16195.avif?t=1771323374\" width=616 height=346 /></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>An intense retro soundtrack:</strong> <br>Combat Cobras includes a retro sound-track featuring Waveshaper and Droid Bishop along with other talented artists.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1378690?t=1771323374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771323374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/40114bbddf3f05dda51bfa940cf44786115cbf8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771323374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/40114bbddf3f05dda51bfa940cf44786115cbf8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771323374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1439